    keep_coarse (retain expansion, children remain active),
    confirm (sub-branches are resolved at parent level),
    close_for_now (all children have fallen below threshold).
- Expanded branches do not hold probability mass directly; their posterior is
  the sum of their children's posteriors, computed automatically.

